name algpseudocodex
category Package
revision 61230
shortdesc Package for typesetting pseudocode
longdesc This package allows typesetting pseudocode in LaTeX. It is
longdesc based on algpseudocode from the algorithmicx package and uses
longdesc the same syntax, but adds several new features and
longdesc improvements. Notable features include customizable indent
longdesc guide lines and the ability to draw boxes around parts of the
longdesc code for highlighting differences. This package also has better
longdesc support for long code lines spanning several lines and improved
longdesc comments.
